
# Bus Booking System

## Tech Stack
- Backend: Node.js + Express + MongoDB
- Frontend: React (Vite)
- Admin Panel: React (Vite)
- Mobile: React Native (Expo)

## Architecture
- Clean Architecture (Backend)
- Monorepo structure

## Apps
- /backend → API
- /frontend → Web App
- /admin-panel → Role-based Admin/Operator Panel
- /mobile → Mobile App

## Admin Panel (Role-wise)
- Login/Register with roles: `ADMIN`, `OPERATOR`, `USER`
- `ADMIN` can:
  - View users (`/api/auth/users`)
  - View and update operator status (`/api/operators/:id/status`)
- `OPERATOR` can:
  - View operators list (`/api/operators`)
- `USER` can authenticate but has no admin-panel permissions

## Required Backend Env Notes
- In `auth-service` env:
  - `ADMIN_CREATION_KEY=<your-secret>` (required to create ADMIN users)
- In `api-gateway` env:
  - `ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173,http://localhost:5174`

## Run Admin Panel
1. `cd admin-panel`
2. `npm install`
3. `npm run dev`
